  "body": "This PR proposes the complete Relay migration and release-control source at c61956f79a0cae963551f271686f1f1298622c53 onto main 874f54c7f4795a07f9f3e4b1b3dd13d0a4b4f500. It includes the ordinary ASP.NET Core API, SDK10 policy, tests, helpers, documentation/evidence history and disabled one-dropdown deployment workflow; it is not workflow-only. All deployment jobs remain literal false; no package rebuild, dispatch, environment/FIC or cloud effect is part of this PR. Exact accepted W5 package E4473862F6A6406B8DC021CFFCB34B82247AAD7640D9FE0CB3659D1A8DBB87FC remains source b32c3fbfe2cdf64056be264d59dcd97df6d4591e. Merge is blocked pending existing protected PR approval/test-merge checks and independent exact publication/inverse readiness. No admin bypass.",
